From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:44:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: rkvdec: Give the HEVC SPS control a default the driver
 accepts

The default value of V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_SPS is all zeros, so its
chroma_format_idc is 0 (monochrome). rkvdec_hevc_validate_sps() refuses
anything but 4:2:0, both in try_ctrl and when streaming starts. So the
control rejects its own default value, and the OUTPUT queue can't start
streaming before userspace has set an SPS. HEVC being the default coded
format, v4l2-compliance fails three tests on the RK3588 decoder:
VIDIOC_G/S/TRY_EXT_CTRLS ("try_ext_ctrls returned an error (22)") and,
in the blocking DQBUF test, VIDIOC_STREAMON and the wait itself.

Make 4:2:0 the default chroma_format_idc of the SPS control.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkvdec/rkvdec.c | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkvdec/rkvdec.c b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkvdec/rkvdec.c
index 9d7b0d279..256bfe5b5 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkvdec/rkvdec.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkvdec/rkvdec.c
@@ -212,6 +212,16 @@ static const struct v4l2_ctrl_ops rkvdec_ctrl_ops = {
 	.s_ctrl = rkvdec_s_ctrl,
 };
 
+/*
+ * The all-zero default SPS has chroma_format_idc 0 (monochrome), which the
+ * driver doesn't support and refuses, so the default value of the control
+ * itself would fail VIDIOC_TRY_EXT_CTRLS and streaming would not start.
+ * Default to 4:2:0 instead.
+ */
+static const struct v4l2_ctrl_hevc_sps rkvdec_hevc_default_sps = {
+	.chroma_format_idc = 1,
+};
+
 static const struct rkvdec_ctrl_desc rkvdec_hevc_ctrl_descs[] = {
 	{
 		.cfg.id = V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_SLICE_PARAMS,
@@ -222,6 +232,7 @@ static const struct rkvdec_ctrl_desc rkvdec_hevc_ctrl_descs[] = {
 	{
 		.cfg.id = V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_SPS,
 		.cfg.ops = &rkvdec_ctrl_ops,
+		.cfg.p_def.p_const = &rkvdec_hevc_default_sps,
 	},
 	{
 		.cfg.id = V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_PPS,
@@ -269,6 +280,7 @@ static const struct rkvdec_ctrl_desc vdpu38x_hevc_ctrl_descs[] = {
 	{
 		.cfg.id = V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_SPS,
 		.cfg.ops = &rkvdec_ctrl_ops,
+		.cfg.p_def.p_const = &rkvdec_hevc_default_sps,
 	},
 	{
 		.cfg.id = V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_PPS,
